      "writtenOn": "2020-09-08T16:52:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In my opinion the helm-chart specifies the version of the container it works with there\u0027s no need to account for different combination of parameters. If you override the image tag with your custom image then you\u0027re in uncharted territory and it\u0027s ok if things are not supported.",
